5,1,1,talk,May,,Hello everyone! Let's make this interesting. I want to see the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme. Let's see if we're actually learning from the past!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A spirited start, May. I believe a pragmatic look at the human element is necessary. I'll examine the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I think it's important to understand where passengers are actually losing time. I'd like to look into the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city, as well as the journey audits on where minutes go.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To make sure our plans are truly realistic, I would like to see the joint operators' committee minutes and the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To understand the long-term financial commitments, I would like to look into the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"It seems we've all claimed our territories! @Benjamin, you're focusing on the staff, while @Midori is all about the passengers. I'm just here to make sure we aren't repeating old mistakes. Anyone else feel like adding something?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a balanced distribution, indeed. I suspect we shall find that the ""territories"" overlap more than we imagine. For now, I am content with my selections. Shall we proceed to the findings?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,I agree with @Benjamin. It feels like we have a good variety of perspectives covered. I'm looking forward to seeing what we all discover and how it helps us choose the best plan.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree with you all. It is lovely to see such a thoughtful approach from everyone. I am quite content with our choices and look forward to hearing what you find.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. It is a peaceful start to our deliberation. I believe we have covered the necessary ground to make an informed decision. I am happy to proceed whenever you all are.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"Since everyone is so agreeable, I'm almost worried! Let's keep this energy going. I'm quite curious to see if those old reports hold any secrets that will surprise us all.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
16,1,3,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, the suspense is almost palpable. I shall maintain my composure and wait for the data to speak for itself. I believe we have exhausted our preliminary chatter.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
18,1,3,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'm a bit nervous but excited to see the results. I hope the data gives us a clear picture of the passengers' experience. I'll be waiting for the findings as well.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
20,1,3,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
21,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is quite a lovely feeling, isn't it? This little bit of anticipation. I shall wait patiently with you all. I am sure we will find something very helpful.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
22,1,3,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I share your anticipation. There is a certain quiet joy in waiting for the truth to emerge from the records. I am ready to move forward.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
